Alarm: ID 01: E-Stop Button Active
How To Fix: Check both E-stop buttons on the AGV. They are located on the left and right sides.
On newer AGVs, the buttons will be red twist-style E-stops. On older AGVs, the buttons will be black push-in style.
Ensure both buttons are disengaged to allow normal operation.

【问题】ID 01 是什么告警？怎么处理？

【上一轮思考】（无）

思考：片段 [Excerpt 1] 直接说明 ID 01 = E-Stop Button Active（急停按钮被按下），并给出了完整处理步骤：检查两侧急停按钮，新款顺时针旋转复位，旧款解除按下状态。答案是：ID 01 是 E-Stop Button Active 告警；处理方法是检查两侧急停按钮，新款顺时针旋转复位，旧款拔出按下的按钮，确保两个按钮都已松开，AGV 即可恢复正常运行。

